    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew Magical Potions</strong>: Use multiple ingredients  to craft powerful potions. Each new day will allow you to expand your store inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Shop</strong>: Use your gold to upgrade your potion shop. Customers will get more difficult to manage each day and you must be dexterous to complete the orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Challenges</strong>: your daily goal will increase the further you get through the campaign, you need to prioritize the right customers and think on your feet to successfully pass the levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brew Magical Potions</strong>: Use multiple ingredients  to craft powerful potions. Each new day will allow you to expand your store inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run Your Shop</strong>: Use your gold to upgrade your potion shop. Customers will get more difficult to manage each day and you must be dexterous to complete the orders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face Challenges</strong>: your daily goal will increase the further you get through the campaign, you need to prioritize the right customers and think on your feet to successfully pass the levels.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Potion Seller is a medieval simulation game where you step into the shoes of a wizard trying to survive in the cutthroat world of alchemy. As the owner of a humble potion shop, your goal is to master the art of potion brewing and make a name for yourself in busy medieval markets.",
